<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<% const isPrivacy = doc === 'privacy'; %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
      <div>
        <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <%- icon('chevron-right') %>
          <span aria-current="page"><%= isPrivacy ? 'Privacy Policy' : 'Terms & Conditions' %></span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow"><%= isPrivacy ? 'Your information' : 'The small print' %></p>
        <h1 class="page-hero__title"><%= isPrivacy ? 'Privacy' : 'Terms &' %><br><em><%= isPrivacy ? 'policy.' : 'conditions.' %></em></h1>
        <p class="page-hero__lede"><%= isPrivacy
          ? 'What we collect, why we collect it, and how you can ask us to stop.'
          : 'The terms that apply to using this website and requesting an appointment.' %></p>
      </div>
      <aside class="page-hero__aside">
        <p>This page is a plain-language summary written for a demonstration clinic. It should be
          reviewed by your own legal adviser before the site goes live.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <nav class="legal__nav" aria-label="Legal documents">
        <a href="/privacy" <%= isPrivacy ? 'aria-current="page" style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600;"' : '' %>>Privacy policy</a>
        <a href="/terms" <%= !isPrivacy ? 'aria-current="page" style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600;"' : '' %>>Terms &amp; conditions</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact the clinic</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="legal__body">
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated 23 November 2026</p>

        <% if (isPrivacy) { %>
          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>Sakura Smile Dental Clinic, 24 Wimpole Street, Marylebone, London W1G 8GP, is the data
            controller for the information described on this page. You can reach us at
            <a href="mailto:<%= clinic.email %>"><%= clinic.email %></a> or on <%= clinic.phone %>.</p>

          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Appointment requests:</strong> your name, phone number, optional email address,
              preferred treatment, preferred dentist, preferred date and time, and any notes you add.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> your name, optional email and phone number, and the
              message you send.</li>
            <li><strong>Clinical records:</strong> created only once you become a patient, and held
              separately under our clinical records policy.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> the minimum needed to serve the site securely, such as
              a session cookie for staff login.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
          <p>We use your details to respond to your request, arrange and confirm your appointment, and
            keep a record of the care we provide. We do not sell your data, and we do not use it for
            marketing without your separate consent.</p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>Appointment requests that do not become appointments are kept for twelve months and then
            deleted. Clinical records are kept in line with UK dental record-keeping requirements.</p>

          <h2>Who can see it</h2>
          <p>Only clinic staff who need it to arrange your care. We use a small number of service
            providers (hosting, email) who process data on our behalf under written agreements.</p>

          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>You can ask for a copy of your information, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete
            anything that is not part of a clinical record. Email
            <a href="mailto:<%= clinic.email %>"><%= clinic.email %></a> and we will respond within one
            month.</p>

          <h2>Cookies</h2>
          <p>This website sets one cookie, and only for clinic staff: a session cookie that keeps an
            administrator signed in to the management area. Visitors who are not signed in receive no
            tracking cookies, and we do not run advertising or analytics pixels.</p>

          <h2>Complaints</h2>
          <p>If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, please tell us first. You
            also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO).</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <h2>Using this website</h2>
          <p>This website provides information about Sakura Smile Dental Clinic and allows you to
            request appointments. By using it you agree to these terms. The content is general
            information, not clinical advice, and it does not replace an examination.</p>

          <h2>Appointment requests</h2>
          <p>Submitting the form creates a <strong>request</strong>, not a confirmed appointment. A
            booking becomes confirmed only when a member of our team has spoken with you and sent a
            written confirmation. Please do not attend until you have that confirmation.</p>

          <h2>Demonstration content</h2>
          <p>Photographs of before-and-after cases and patient stories on this site are clearly labelled
            demonstration content. They are not real patients, and no clinical outcome is claimed or
            implied. Real cases will be published only with written patient consent.</p>

          <h2>Prices</h2>
          <p>Prices shown are starting points and may change. Your written treatment plan is the
            authoritative figure for your care.</p>

          <h2>Cancellations</h2>
          <p>We ask for at least 24 hours’ notice to change or cancel an appointment so the time can be
            offered to someone else. Repeated late cancellations may incur a fee, which we will always
            explain in advance.</p>

          <h2>Emergencies</h2>
          <p>This website is not an emergency service. If you have facial swelling affecting breathing
            or swallowing, or significant trauma, call 999 or attend your nearest A&amp;E department.</p>

          <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>The design, text and imagery of this website belong to the clinic or its licensors and may
            not be reproduced without permission.</p>

          <h2>Liability</h2>
          <p>We take care to keep the information accurate, but we do not warrant that the site will be
            uninterrupted or error-free. Nothing in these terms limits liability for death or personal
            injury caused by negligence.</p>

          <h2>Governing law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.</p>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
